{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034790/extras/92b52eed660603c4e1d8e427f298cfee.avif?t=1758975649\" width=936 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Little Devil</i>, a top-down roguelike horror-comedy packed with grotesque demons, twisted humor, and chaotic dungeon runs. Unleash bizarre powers from your hands, face unpredictable enemies, and embrace permadeath mayhem in procedurally generated dungeons that keep every run fresh and surprising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 2D pixel art, a top-down perspective, and 90s-inspired retro flair, <i>Little Devil</i> delivers nostalgic visuals, over-the-top comedy, and darkly surreal horror. Explore rooms full of absurd monsters, traps, and environmental hazards \u2014 every corner hides something shocking, hilarious, or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story comes alive through the <i>Little Devil</i> comic series, revealing the origins of your powers and the humorously sinister world you\u2019re about to conquer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to laugh, scream, and die\u2026 again and again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034790?t=1758975649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034790?t=1758975649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034790/9b9e4f74932e2f05a7c175f0397c468719bb4632/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758975649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034790/9b9e4f74932e2f05a7c175f0397c468719bb4632/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758975649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"descr